{"id":50534,"date":"2026-04-07T18:29:39","date_gmt":"2026-04-07T17:29:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/torres-vedras-night-run-urban-trail\/"},"modified":"2026-09-27T13:31:33","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T12:31:33","slug":"torres-vedras-night-run-urban-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/torres-vedras-night-run-urban-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um desafio desportivo noturno singular promovido pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Torres Vedras<\/strong> e pela <strong>Promotorres E.M.<\/strong>, em parceria t\u00e9cnica com o Acad\u00e9mico de Torres Vedras, Dolce Furadouro, CAP Running, GOAT \u2013 West Trail Team e Turres Trail Clube, integrado no programa das Festas da Cidade. Num conceito inovador de segmentos cronometrados independentes em sistema &#8216;open road&#8217;, a prova percorre o patrim\u00f3nio hist\u00f3rico, escadarias e os trilhos emblem\u00e1ticos que rodeiam a cidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento est\u00e1 sediado no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos de Torres Vedras (Expotorres) e contempla o <strong>Trail de 20 km<\/strong> (composto por 3 segmentos: Forte de 4 km com 160m D+, Castro de 9 km com 350m D+ e Pista de 7 km com 260m D+), o <strong>Trail de 13 km<\/strong> (Forte + Castro), a <strong>Caminhada Aventura de 13 km<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada Guiada de 8 km<\/strong>. Os atletas gerem livremente o intervalo entre setores ap\u00f3s o check-in no p\u00f3rtico, beneficiando de abastecimentos, seguro desportivo, brinde finisher, balne\u00e1rios com banhos quentes e op\u00e7\u00e3o de jantar conv\u00edvio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; fo