radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 8,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 14\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Aventura 13 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:30 \u2022 510m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 7,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 14\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Guiada 8 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 24 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:35<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica:<\/strong> 3,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 14\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o formato do 6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 18:00 no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (Expotorres). O formato \u00e9 composto por segmentos cronometrados independentes (Forte, Castro e Pista) com partidas abertas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 20:45.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a din\u00e2mica dos segmentos cronometrados?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os participantes do Trail 20 km completam 3 segmentos (4 km, 9 km e 7 km), enquanto no Trail 13 km e Caminhada Aventura realizam 2 segmentos (4 km e 9 km). Cada atleta define livremente a ordem e o tempo de descanso entre percursos atrav\u00e9s de check-in nos p\u00f3rticos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se situam o secretariado, as partidas e as chegadas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as partidas, chegadas e a log\u00edstica geral do evento concentram-se no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (Expotorres) em Torres Vedras.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos limite?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 14 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Recorde Pessoal: 8,00 \u20ac para o Trail 20 km e 13 km, 7,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada Aventura e 3,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada Guiada. O jantar p\u00f3s-prova custa 6,00 \u20ac para participantes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que servi\u00e7os de apoio est\u00e3o assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, refor\u00e7o alimentar l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido, brinde finisher, seguro desportivo e balne\u00e1rios com duches no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-24\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Torres Vedras, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Torres Vedras\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Torres Vedras e Promotorres E.M.\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o formato do 6\u00ba Torres Vedras Night Run Urban Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se na noite de s\u00e1bado, 24 de outubro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 18:00 no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (Expotorres). O formato \u00e9 composto por segmentos cronometrados independentes (Forte, Castro e Pista) com partidas abertas at\u00e9 \u00e0s 20:45.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a din\u00e2mica dos segmentos cronometrados?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Os participantes do Trail 20 km completam 3 segmentos (4 km, 9 km e 7 km), enquanto no Trail 13 km e Caminhada Aventura realizam 2 segmentos (4 km e 9 km). Cada atleta define livremente a ordem e o tempo de descanso entre percursos atrav\u00e9s de check-in nos p\u00f3rticos.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se situam o secretariado, as partidas e as chegadas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todas as partidas, chegadas e a log\u00edstica geral do evento concentram-se no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos (Expotorres) em Torres Vedras.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e prazos limite?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 14 de outubro de 2026 na plataforma Recorde Pessoal: 8,00 \u20ac para o Trail 20 km e 13 km, 7,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada Aventura e 3,00 \u20ac para a Caminhada Guiada. O jantar p\u00f3s-prova custa 6,00 \u20ac para participantes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que servi\u00e7os de apoio est\u00e3o assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, refor\u00e7o alimentar l\u00edquido e s\u00f3lido, brinde finisher, seguro desportivo e balne\u00e1rios com duches no Pavilh\u00e3o Multiusos.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68609,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,672,497],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-50534","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","eve